<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Feb manufacturing sales rise five pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Feb manufacturing sales rise five pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch February manufacturing sales were some five percent higher than in the same month of 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>The CBS manufacturing sales figures refer to the guilder value of manufacturers' sales and are usually published one to two weeks before manufacturing production figures which show the rise or fall in volume terms.</p>
</text>
